</title>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1316027001">
<title>
MAF Sensor
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove MAF sensor with IAT sensor-1. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1316026"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Connect MAF sensor with IAT sensor-1 (1) to 12 V battery (2), 3 new 1.5 V batteries in series (3) and voltmeter (4) as shown in figure.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check that voltage varies depending on amount of blowing air as shown in graph below.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
If faulty condition is found, replace MAF sensor with IAT sensor-1.
</ptxt>
